aption>舒子晨悄悄剪短髮了。（IG@nikita.hsu）</figcaption></figure><figure><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20200608/346694170888507392.jpeg/xSDwrR40-PQaWQF_xLvJXI8sajSS9To8PhQGVz4UBlc\" alt=\"舒子晨悄悄剪短髮了。（IG@nikita.hsu）\"><figcaption>舒子晨悄悄剪短髮了。（IG@nikita.hsu）</figcaption></figure><figure><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20200601/344133914912231424.jpeg/uXik_kmSTagz3VySNl7C50tzfgCqGZjoZb3F0mW9xdI\" alt=\"舒子晨（IG@nikita.hsu）\"><figcaption>舒子晨（IG@nikita.hsu）</figcaption></figure><figure><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20200601/344133910499823616.jpeg/uX079lbR-VxZv5qLO4KieknlTJsGsf7GvQ4Q3b0OEN0\" alt=\"舒子晨（IG@nikita.hsu）\"><figcaption>舒子晨（IG@nikita.hsu）</figcaption></figure><figure><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20200601/344133912378871808.jpeg/N3XLTNV5uaUmk0HEiy0QM_0gQa2JGC-W7lGF2e5Rhdk\" alt=\"舒子晨（IG@nikita.hsu）\"><figcaption>舒子晨（IG@nikita.hsu）</figcaption></figure><figure><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20200601/344133908360728576.jpeg/nNGfHr_cVsjH66NnxoZdQ_2IdZ31Bl6UAliO3QJYjt0\" alt=\"舒子晨（IG@nikita.hsu）\"><figcaption>舒子晨（IG@nikita.hsu）</figcaption></figure><figure><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20200601/344133906120970240.jpeg/ZR-dzmDF8tepJpyCWEEFSposxhgZdWibwaP8AMGj_AA\" alt=\"舒子晨（IG@nikita.hsu）\"><figcaption>舒子晨（IG@nikita.hsu）</figcaption></figure><figure><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20200601/344133904028012544.jpeg/_wR0mv3SdynJwACVpNGkc8jIMH0Q4MEvu5_IOLufyDg\" alt=\"舒子晨（IG@nikita.hsu）\"><figcaption>舒子晨（IG@nikita.hsu）</figcaption></figure><figure><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20200601/344133901897306112.jpeg/CqrOCpAsjBJmror-fgSt8NNjZqbx_UhH7xcbbe8XG20\" alt=\"舒子晨（IG@nikita.hsu）\"><figcaption>舒子晨（IG@nikita.hsu）</figcaption></figure><figure><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20200601/344133900014063616.jpeg/dlVSZ_PMBkHuf9sa-j1rgf0Dmx2-6NBL19pp7dfaae0\" alt=\"舒子晨（IG@nikita.hsu）\"><figcaption>舒子晨（IG@nikita.hsu）</figcaption></figure><figure><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20200601/344133899200368641.jpeg/y_kg0CTlw8CUUuPt-x1Olizqh_X-tk5dzRi7PM0Yuzw\" alt=\"舒子晨（IG@nikita.hsu）\"><figcaption>舒子晨（IG@nikita.hsu）</figcaption></figure><figure><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20200601/344133897774305280.jpeg/x5w3q6aaFX31i8RyW2lD8IANLHdoNAB8_m4WgP5uFoA\" alt=\"舒子晨（IG@nikita.hsu）\"><figcaption>舒子晨（IG@nikita.hsu）</figcaption></figure><figure><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20200601/344133897157742592.jpeg/fQL4CqXFF6jlq0gXGLhM8EaZyFjaCY_hb2Dk829g5PM\" alt=\"舒子晨（IG@nikita.hsu）\"><figcaption>舒子晨（IG@nikita.hsu）</figcaption></figure><figure><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20200601/344133894406279168.jpeg/sx5JXm7pSmsHtmNYcGnNSW5f-lz8zo-SnOKWS5zilks\" alt=\"舒子晨（IG@nikita.hsu）\"><figcaption>舒子晨（IG@nikita.hsu）</figcaption></figure><figure><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20200601/344133895681347584.jpeg/ew9zK0HHcZrCjZ13DnRNpTMfM6uIr5BmBfM83gXzPN4\" alt=\"舒子晨（IG@nikita.hsu）\"><figcaption>舒子晨（IG@nikita.hsu）</figcaption></figure><p>近來舒子晨在Podcast節目《果子貍》分享，她罹患腸胃炎的時候上吐下瀉，坐在馬桶拉肚子，嘴巴還會「嘔」幾聲，當時排泄物動不動就會洩漏出來，舒子晨說：「無法控制我的括約肌，一個咳嗽就（剉）出來了。」</p><figure><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260513/1131227610815139840298457.jpeg/kjZZNOBrYn9XzvbeoPGlWdaPW-UelZlYeiM4GnojOBo\" alt=\"舒子晨與她的老公許美中。（Instagram@nikita.hsu）\"><figcaption>舒子晨與她的老公許美中。（Instagram@nikita.hsu）</figcaption></figure><p>因為害許美中換太多次床單，舒子晨歉疚表示要睡地上，許美中用公主抱把舒子晨輕輕放在床上，不以為意說：「你幹嘛，我再洗就好了？」接著他把髒掉的褲子放在浴缸，全部用手洗，舒子晨感動表示：</p><p>延伸閱讀：大S女兒小玥兒開通IG賬號　追蹤名單藏思念　網友淚：要好好長大</p><figure><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260511/1130457848203972608169573.jpeg/vq9_oX_wzhyYH1ISFXdRkkZDaHbKW-wqo1u2e6Nbtns\" alt=\"【延伸閱讀：大S女兒小玥兒開通IG賬號　追蹤名單藏思念　網友淚：要好好長大】大S（徐熙媛）去年2月在日本病逝，留下一雙兒女玥兒和箖箖，目前姊弟倆由前夫汪小菲照顧，有眼尖網友發現，12歲的玥兒最近開通了IG帳號。（微博@大S）\"><figcaption>【延伸閱讀：大S女兒小玥兒開通IG賬號　追蹤名單藏思念　網友淚：要好好長大】大S（徐熙媛）去年2月在日本病逝，留下一雙兒女玥兒和箖箖，目前姊弟倆由前夫汪小菲照顧，有眼尖網友發現，12歲的玥兒最近開通了IG帳號。（微博@大S）</figcaption></figure><figure><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260511/1130459154411163648805291.jpeg/XB06Taq-6ri3X3-vvYEmmhhRZ1bqnSq9Aluo3gJbqN4\" alt=\"玥兒開通IG賬號關注了大S。（IG@yue_wonggg）\"><figcaption>玥兒開通IG賬號關注了大S。（IG@yue_wonggg）</figcaption></figure><figure><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260511/1130460406851047424218476.jpeg/AgFflVGqW4rWWetnfMl33CAHmkGmiorQmjiLUpo4i1I\" alt=\"玥兒開通IG賬號，個人簡介有和大S相似的古靈精怪性格。（IG@yue_wonggg）\"><figcaption>玥兒開通IG賬號，個人簡介有和大S相似的古靈精怪性格。（IG@yue_wonggg）</figcaption></figure><figure><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260511/1130460409300652032125076.jpeg/o_3e01vd8IqiA4Qg-LOptXrZ7yc-gA9WZgnFWGYJxVg\" alt=\"玥兒IG賬號下網友暖心留言。（IG@yue_wonggg）\"><figcaption>玥兒IG賬號下網友暖心留言。（IG@yue_wonggg）</figcaption></figure><figure><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260511/1130460411465043968405716.jpeg/faRJqfPnYfsDVRHlsdkzjWGFw9httLGjylToRcpU6EU\" alt=\"玥兒IG賬號下網友暖心留言。（IG@yue_wonggg）\"><figcaption>玥兒IG賬號下網友暖心留言。（IG@yue_wonggg）</figcaption></figure><figure><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260511/1130459149927190528130985.jpeg/tn83ui10DqWHdDOJVJW_z2Mus_6JdAoJIVsTTCFbE0w\" alt=\"大S和玥兒（微博@大S）\"><figcaption>大S和玥兒（微博@大S）</figcaption></figure><figure><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260511/1130459152347435008385072.jpeg/VHuRYzMGFb5k6lwqM1NPzbdSfLCjNlF3Gz7Q0Bs-0NA\" alt=\"大S和玥兒（微博@大S）\"><figcaption>大S和玥兒（微博@大S）</figcaption></figure><figure><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260511/1130459154591518720759638.jpeg/Ol4w-hLxzwuyMAnp8Xnap5Z_2tz8UDmBi2k5J4tpOSc\" alt=\"大S和玥兒（微博@大S）\"><figcaption>大S和玥兒（微博@大S）</figcaption></figure><figure><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260511/1130459152351629312083547.jpeg/ONAvFQwe3hnT_WGk6IO7KxFPOHHTDHvIzBV6BcwVegU\" alt=\"大S和玥兒（微博@大S）\"><figcaption>大S和玥兒（微博@大S）</figcaption></figure><figure><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260511/1130459150149488640460987.jpeg/cIJ0lD4MkB6-3WJFLMRPTJe